        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our current land pipeline goal is to maintain an approximate four-to-five year future sales order pace supply of lots, which we believe provides an appropriate planning horizon to address regulatory matters, perform land development and manage to our business plan for future closings.",
        "start_character": 20252,
        "end_character": 20537
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The homes to be offered depend upon many factors, including the guidelines, if any, of the existing community, housing available in the area, the needs and desired housing product for a particular market based on consumer research, and pricing targets for the desired product offering in the surrounding area, though we almost exclusively use our standardized home design plans in our communities.",
        "start_character": 25386,
        "end_character": 25783
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also operate a financial services segment, which offers title and escrow, mortgage, and insurance services to our homebuyers.",
        "start_character": 589,
        "end_character": 717
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although entitlements are almost always obtained before land is purchased, we are typically still required to secure a variety of other governmental approvals and permits prior to and during development, and the process of obtaining such approvals and permits can be lengthy.",
        "start_character": 24028,
        "end_character": 24303
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As such, these finished lots may be more attractive to us, despite their higher price, as we typically can immediately bring the community to market and begin home construction as well as mitigate potential cost and time risks that can occur during the land entitlement and development process.",
        "start_character": 26114,
        "end_character": 26408
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At December 31, 2025, we were actively selling homes in 336 communities, with base prices ranging from approximately $161,000 to $1,000,000.",
        "start_character": 1510,
        "end_character": 1650
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During the year ended December 31, 2025, we invested approximately $1.9 billion in land acquisition and development and secured approximately 5,500 net new lots, compared to 37,000 net new lots in 2024.",
        "start_character": 20538,
        "end_character": 20740
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Environmental Protection Agency (\"EPA\"), we will continue to monitor developments and adjust our approach as needed.",
        "start_character": 8680,
        "end_character": 8796
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to our robust digital marketing platform, we may also use furnished model homes as a marketing tool to demonstrate to prospective homebuyers the advantages of the designs and features of our homes.",
        "start_character": 34887,
        "end_character": 35096
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, governing agencies may impose entitlement, development or construction moratoriums and therefore we could become subject to delays or may be precluded entirely from developing communities in the future as a result.",
        "start_character": 48233,
        "end_character": 48460
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Midway through 2024, we introduced a strategic shift of selling homes later in the construction process which enables us to compete more effectively with the resale home market by shortening the delivery time from sale to close, aligning more closely with typical resale home closing timelines.",
        "start_character": 7063,
        "end_character": 7357
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000833079-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000833079-26-000010-eb8d73987611568d",
        "accession_number": "0000833079-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Once we secure undeveloped land, we generally supervise and control the entitlement and development of the land through contractual agreements with professional consultants and subcontractors.",
